## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## THE JEWELRY (`story.ni:10735-10752`): four pieces, one chosen. They are
## laid out in the shop when the case is unlocked (DS48) and the three not
## taken go back under glass with the valuable jewelry (DS49B). Taking one
## is the source's "now the noun is worn" — here it arrives in her hands
## and `wear` is hers (GH #360).
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

define trait dress-jewelry
  after the player taking
    phrase sandler-ds49b
    move the silver ring offstage when not the player has the silver ring
    move the silver pendant offstage when not the player has the silver pendant
    move the silver bracelet offstage when not the player has the silver bracelet
    move the silver brooch offstage when not the player has the silver brooch
    move the valuable jewelry to the Jeweler's Shop
    change the display case to locked
    change Pieter to guarding
    change the preparations to escorted
  end after
end trait

create the silver ring
  aka ring, diamond ring, silver diamond ring, jewelry, jewelery, jewel, jewels, gem, gems, gemstone, gemstones, diamonds, diamond, silver, encrusted
  wearable
  dress-jewelry

  The ring is silver and inlaid all over with tiny, expertly cut diamonds,
  set in an intricate pattern of looping swirls around the circumference of
  the ring, like curls of glittering thread.

create the silver pendant
  aka pendant, necklace, teardrop, link, links, silver links, sapphire, sapphires, jewelry, jewelery, jewel, jewels, gem, gems, gemstone, gemstones, diamonds, diamond, silver, encrusted
  wearable
  dress-jewelry

  The pendant is a teardrop the size of your thumb, encrusted with diamonds
  and sapphires, hanging from a necklace of delicate, silver links.

create the silver bracelet
  aka bracelet, band, silver band, sapphire, sapphires, jewelry, jewelery, jewel, jewels, gem, gems, gemstone, gemstones, diamonds, diamond, silver, encrusted
  wearable
  dress-jewelry

  The bracelet is a band of silver, just big enough to squeeze over the
  bones of your hand. A circle of diamonds surrounds a larger sapphire set in
  the center.

create the silver brooch
  aka brooch, pin, cup, stem, rim, silver cup, sapphire, sapphires, jewelry, jewelery, jewel, jewels, gem, gems, gemstone, gemstones, diamonds, diamond, silver, encrusted
  wearable
  dress-jewelry

  The brooch is wrought of silver in the shape of a cup, symbol of the
  Goddess Magdalena. The stem is decorated with diamonds, and a line of
  sapphires adorns the cup's rim.

