  Pieter is here, looking around warily.
or
  Pieter is here, fingering his sword hilt.
or
  Pieter is here, muttering to himself.
or
  Pieter is here, shifting his feet impatiently.
or
  Pieter is here, keeping a close eye on you.
end phrase

