## `story.ni:10801-10802`, the letter shown to him.

define phrase pieter-dont-lose-that
  'Don't lose that,' Pieter says.
end phrase

define phrase pieter-dont-lose-that-credentials
  'Don't lose that,' Pieter says. 'You'll need that to prove your
  credentials to the Chorus Brothers.'
