  (TODO during play-testing — 'I have a question…' you start to say. 'And I
  have answers,' says the clothier, bowing deeply. 'Please, dear, ask away.'
  His cheapest dress? He would not dignify that with a price; try that hussy
  who runs the silk tent in Grubber's. What to wear to the ball? 'Sister,
